menu "ESP WebRTC Camera Configuration"
    config APPRTC_ROLE_TYPE
        int "WebRTC role type"
        default 1
        range 0 1
        help
            Role reported by get-role and in the logs (0: MASTER, 1: VIEWER).
            With AppRTC it does not change the session: the device sends the
            offer when it is first in the room and answers when it joins a room
            a browser is already in.

    config APPRTC_AUTO_CONNECT
        bool "Auto-connect to signaling server on startup"
        default y
        help
            Selects the boot log banner only: the device connects to the signaling
            server on startup either way.

    config APPRTC_LOG_VERBOSE
        bool "Enable verbose AppRTC logging"
        default n
        help
            Enable verbose logging for AppRTC signaling.
endmenu
